WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.110
IN and EXISTS can sometimes be rewritten into
equivalent forms But

00:00:06.136 --> 00:00:13.392
when writing the first version choose the operator
that expresses the business question clearly
Membership

00:00:13.419 --> 00:00:20.685
suggests IN Existence suggests EXISTS Absence

00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:26.596
of a related match suggests NOT EXISTS Clear
semantics make the query

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:29.240
easier to explain review and debug
